n, high-contrast product photography, custom typography, and pixel-perfect layout. No generic gradient orbs or stock imagery. Every visual element is clearly custom-designed for a specific product line - the antithesis of an AI website builder template.",most_ai_sentence:"",ai_signals:[{signal:'Minor: "all-new" product descriptor',evidence:'"All-new iPad Air."',severity:"low"},{signal:"Superlative marketing language",evidence:'"The world\'s most popular laptop."',severity:"low"}],human_signals:[{signal:"Extremely specific product names and model numbers",evidence:"M4 Pro chip, 14-inch MacBook Pro"},{signal:"Verified real pricing and availability",evidence:"From $999 · Available now"},{signal:"Distinctive brand voice - telegraphic, no filler",evidence:'"All chip. No compromise."'},{signal:"Custom legal disclaimers referencing real features",evidence:"Battery life varies by settings and usage"},{signal:"No AI phrase patterns detected in copy",evidence:"Zero hits for delve/leverage/seamless/unlock"}],patterns:[],codeNotes:["Custom semantic HTML, no visual-builder fingerprints detected","All images have proper alt text"],layoutNotes:["Non-uniform section heights and paragraph lengths - clearly hand-designed","14 unique section templates - not a repeating grid"],categories:{style_consistency:{score:8,note:"Telegraphic headline style varies naturally between product lines."},code_patterns:{score:5,note:"Hand-crafted markup, no builder or template class patterns."},content:{score:6,note:"Every claim ties to a real product spec, model name, or price."},copyright:{score:4,note:"Deep legal pages and dated press releases going back decades."},images:{score:5,note:"Custom product photography with descriptive alt text throughout."},source_code:{score:3,note:"No AI generator tags, comments, or scripts anywhere in source."},domain:{score:2,note:"One of the most established brand domains on the internet."}}}},h={scanId:"demo",score:87,verdict:"Pure AI-generated marketing filler",confidence:"high",summary:'"In today\'s fast-paced digital landscape" is the opening line - an instant red flag matched on 34,000+ AI-generated sites. The copy stacks four AI buzzwords per sentence, every paragraph is 142 characters, and the testimonial grid uses generic names ("Sarah M., Designer") with interchangeable praise. Nothing here could not have been written by ChatGPT in 12 seconds.',title:"Example AI Agency",remaining:3,limit:3,analysis:{verdict_detail:'The tone is uniformly upbeat and content-free. Every section follows the same structure: vague opening claim, bulleted benefit list, generic CTA. The only concrete numbers are fabricated round figures ("500+ clients", "10+ years"). The design is a three-column hero + feature grid + testimonials template with gradient blobs - indistinguishable from a Mixo or Durable output.',visual_notes:"Generic hero with purple gradient orb, three-column feature icon grid, stock-photo testimonial avatars, and a footer with identical layout to 12,000+ AI builder sites. No brand-specific visual identity.",most_ai_sentence:"In today's fast-paced digital landscape, we leverage cutting-edge solutions to seamlessly empower your business and unlock its full potential.",ai_signals:[{signal:"Classic AI opener phrase",evidence:"In today's fast-paced digital landscape",severity:"high"},{signal:"Buzzword stacking",evidence:"leverage cutting-edge solutions to seamlessly empower",severity:"high"},{signal:"Generic fake testimonial grid",evidence:'"Sarah M., Designer - This transformed my workflow!"',severity:"high"},{signal:"Hollow CTA",evidence:"unlock your business's full potential today",severity:"medium"},{signal:"Round fabricated numbers",evidence:"500+ satisfied clients · 10+ years of experience",severity:"medium"}],human_signals:[],patterns:[{label:'"in today\'s ... landscape"',count:2,tier:"strong"},{label:'"leverage" (verb)',count:3,tier:"weak"},{label:'"seamless/seamlessly"',count:4,tier:"weak"},{label:'"cutting-edge"',count:2,tier:"weak"},{label:'"unlock your ..."',count:2,tier:"weak"}],codeNotes:["74% generic/utility CSS classes - visual builder markup","91% of 22 images have empty alt text"],layoutNotes:["Uniform paragraph lengths (avg 142 chars, ±8) - AI writes even blocks",'FAQ section: 8 of 12 headings match "What is X?" pattern'],categories:{style_consistency:{score:91,note:"Every paragraph is 135-150 chars with identical sentence rhythm."},code_patterns:{score:84,note:"74% builder CSS classes and three identical section templates repeated."},content:{score:93,note:"Zero verifiable facts; every sentence is interchangeable benefit-speak."},copyright:{score:72,note:"Only a current-year copyright, no archive, no dated content anywhere."},images:{score:88,note:"91% of images have empty alt text and stock gradient-orb visuals."},source_code:{score:76,note:"Builder-generated markup with inline style dumps on every section."},domain:{score:64,note:"Generic keyword domain with no verifiable brand identity behind it."}}}},f=["Executive summary a business owner can act on","Section-by-section AI heatmap","6 human rewrites of your worst paragraphs","Copy-paste title tag & meta description","7-point SEO & Google-penalty audit","6 paste-ready fix-it prompts for ChatGPT","Brand voice analysis + dos & don'ts","7-step action plan ordered by impact","UX, conversion & content-gap audit","PDF download + permanent share link","Zero ads"],g=[{step:"01",title:"Paste a URL",desc:"Any public website. No signup, no email."},{step:"02",title:"We run forensics",desc:"40+ phrase patterns, HTML fingerprints, layout metrics and a full-page screenshot - then a vision AI weighs all of it."},{step:"03",title:"Get a verdict",desc:"A 0-100 AI score with verbatim quotes as evidence, in about 15 seconds."}];e.s(["default",0,function(){let[o,p]=(0,s.useState)("free"),[u,y]=(0,s.useState)(""),[b,v]=(0,s.useState)(!1),[j,N]=(0,s.useState)(!1),[w,k]=(0,s.useState)(null),[A,S]=(0,s.useState)(null),[C,P]=(0,s.useState)(null